openMCX modifications of Open5GS
================================

The image open5gs:2.8.0-mcx built from this directory contains Open5GS (Sukchan Lee and contributors,
https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs), tag v2.8.0, commit 157f611a530e292e40ec50f9d23f0ef5d4fcd6a6, modified by openMCX
for tutorial 5 (MCX over LTE), built over gradiant/open5gs:2.8.0 (https://github.com/Gradiant/5g-images), whose
binaries and libraries it replaces.

