Modifications (AGPL-3.0 section 5(a))
-------------------------------------
Each modified file carries the notice "Modified by openMCX, 2026 (MCX over LTE)". The changes, as patches against
commit 157f611:

  patches/open5gs/0001   PCRF: the AF-Application-Identifier of an AA-Request (TS 29.214 5.3.5) is kept; an AUDIO
                         media component of an MCPTT AF session gets QCI 65 and a VIDEO component of an MCVideo AF
                         session QCI 67 (TS 23.379 5.7.3, TS 23.203 table 6.1.7) instead of 1 and 2. Other AF
                         sessions are unchanged.
  patches/open5gs/0002   The modification notices.

Corresponding source
--------------------
The complete source of the image is the upstream repository at tag v2.8.0 with the patches above applied: the
Dockerfile recreates it (build-images.sh). The image names the commit and the patches' SHA-256 in
/usr/share/doc/open5gs/SOURCE and as labels.
